The problem with jokes in philosophy is that they often turn out to be new =
theories, unrecognized even by the original joker.=A0 taDA!

And, of course, you miss the crucial point that it is not clear that {la ts=
ani be zo'e} does identify the same referent as {la tsani}; the buried assu=
mption, that sumti-tails behave the same after {la} as after {le}, is one o=
f the items in dispute.=A0=20




